  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "为什么懂业务的人，能让 AI Agent 做得更多？因为责任边界没有外包。",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 5.568,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.167,
      "spokenEnd": 4.926,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Anthropic 在二零二六年六月发布了一项隐私保护分析，覆盖约四十万次 Claude Code 交互会话和约二十三万五千名用户，观察期从二零二五年十月到二零二六年四月。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 11.496,
      "audioStart": 4.927,
      "spokenStart": 5.086,
      "spokenEnd": 15.798,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "研究看到的不是专家把每个动作抓得更紧。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.48,
      "audioStart": 15.79,
      "spokenStart": 15.958,
      "spokenEnd": 18.631,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "相反，领域理解越清楚，Agent 每条指令后的行动链越长，遇到错误时也更容易被带回正确方向。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.44,
      "audioStart": 18.574,
      "spokenStart": 18.731,
      "spokenEnd": 25.369,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这期会把发现整理成一张责任分工卡：规划由谁定，执行交给谁，验证看什么，失败时谁接管。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.488,
      "audioStart": 25.368,
      "spokenStart": 25.529,
      "spokenEnd": 32.23,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它是本期的实践推导，不是 Anthropic 官方模板。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.576,
      "audioStart": 32.16,
      "spokenStart": 32.33,
      "spokenEnd": 35.095,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "视频全程干货高价值，让你成为更擅长使用 AI 的人，内容较长，点点关注收藏不迷路。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.576,
      "audioStart": 35.098,
      "spokenStart": 35.255,
      "spokenEnd": 41.027,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第一步先看真实分工，而不是把自主程度想成一个开或关的按钮。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.992,
      "audioStart": 41.047,
      "spokenStart": 41.207,
      "spokenEnd": 45.396,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "研究把决策分成两类。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.184,
      "audioStart": 45.388,
      "spokenStart": 45.556,
      "spokenEnd": 46.938,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "规划回答做什么、选哪条路线和怎样算完成；执行回答改哪些文件、写什么代码和运行哪些命令。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.536,
      "audioStart": 46.881,
      "spokenStart": 47.038,
      "spokenEnd": 53.776,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "在典型会话里，人平均做出约百分之七十的规划决策，却只做出约百分之二十的执行决策。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.648,
      "audioStart": 53.781,
      "spokenStart": 53.936,
      "spokenEnd": 59.793,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "换句话说，常见模式是人决定要建什么，Agent 决定具体怎样建。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.208,
      "audioStart": 59.778,
      "spokenStart": 59.953,
      "spokenEnd": 64.341,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这并不等于人只写一句需求就离场。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3,
      "audioStart": 64.341,
      "spokenStart": 64.501,
      "spokenEnd": 66.701,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "典型会话大约有四轮往返，每轮都可以重新校正方向。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.584,
      "audioStart": 66.646,
      "spokenStart": 66.801,
      "spokenEnd": 70.591,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "每条用户提示平均会触发大约十个 Agent 动作，有些会话远高于这个数字，所以每个检查点都可能承载很长的行动链。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.52,
      "audioStart": 70.59,
      "spokenStart": 70.751,
      "spokenEnd": 78.468,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "真正要写清的不是允许 Agent 做几步，而是哪些决定必须留给懂问题的人。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.496,
      "audioStart": 78.464,
      "spokenStart": 78.628,
      "spokenEnd": 83.321,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 83.327,
      "spokenStart": 83.481,
      "spokenEnd": 84.166,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，把做什么和怎样做分开记录。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.808,
      "audioStart": 84.111,
      "spokenStart": 84.266,
      "spokenEnd": 86.273,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，让 Agent 承担可验证的执行链，而不是替人定义目标。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.584,
      "audioStart": 86.275,
      "spokenStart": 86.433,
      "spokenEnd": 90.216,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，用阶段检查点保持方向可纠正。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.552,
      "audioStart": 90.218,
      "spokenStart": 90.376,
      "spokenEnd": 93.128,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二步要理解为什么专业度会放大 Agent，而不是简单压缩 Agent 的空间。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.352,
      "audioStart": 93.143,
      "spokenStart": 93.308,
      "spokenEnd": 97.851,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "研究按任务把用户表现出的专业度分成五级。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.84,
      "audioStart": 97.839,
      "spokenStart": 98.011,
      "spokenEnd": 101.048,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它看的是指令是否精确、要求怎样验证，以及谁在纠正谁，不是职位或笼统能力。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.336,
      "audioStart": 100.984,
      "spokenStart": 101.148,
      "spokenEnd": 106.677,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "同一个人换到陌生领域可能是新手；不会写代码的会计，只要能说清月末对账规则并发现边界错误，也可能是该任务的专家。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 9.36,
      "audioStart": 106.674,
      "spokenStart": 106.837,
      "spokenEnd": 115.389,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "典型新手会话中，每条提示大约触发五个 Agent 动作和约六百词输出。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.376,
      "audioStart": 115.388,
      "spokenStart": 115.549,
      "spokenEnd": 120.132,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "典型专家会话中，行动链超过两倍，约十二个动作；输出约三千二百词，是新手会话的五倍左右。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.296,
      "audioStart": 120.129,
      "spokenStart": 120.292,
      "spokenEnd": 126.792,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "在控制工作模式、任务价值、月份、职业和模型家族后，专业度每提高一级，动作数仍增加约百分之九，输出增加约百分之十三。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 9.648,
      "audioStart": 126.804,
      "spokenStart": 126.952,
      "spokenEnd": 135.81,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这不是说文字越多越好，而是清晰约束让 Agent 能在一次交接中安全推进更多可检查工作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.008,
      "audioStart": 135.802,
      "spokenStart": 135.97,
      "spokenEnd": 142.166,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 142.172,
      "spokenStart": 142.326,
      "spokenEnd": 143.011,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，专业度是针对当前任务的理解。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 142.955,
      "spokenStart": 143.111,
      "spokenEnd": 145.413,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，明确约束会延长 Agent 的有效行动链。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.408,
      "audioStart": 145.409,
      "spokenStart": 145.573,
      "spokenEnd": 148.176,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，用可验证产物衡量工作，不用输出长度代替质量。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.464,
      "audioStart": 148.177,
      "spokenStart": 148.336,
      "spokenEnd": 151.997,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三步是按能力与不确定性分工，而不是按人和机器简单切一刀。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.352,
      "audioStart": 152.017,
      "spokenStart": 152.177,
      "spokenEnd": 156.727,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "稳定、可逆、规则清楚的执行可以成批交给 Agent，例如读取文件、机械修改、运行检查和汇总证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.92,
      "audioStart": 156.723,
      "spokenStart": 156.887,
      "spokenEnd": 164.006,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "目标定义、价值冲突、隐含约束和高代价取舍要由人负责，因为这些决定依赖领域背景和后果判断。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.704,
      "audioStart": 164.008,
      "spokenStart": 164.166,
      "spokenEnd": 171.084,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当规则虽清楚但环境陌生时，可以让 Agent 先勘察并列出假设，人在执行前确认边界。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.768,
      "audioStart": 171.083,
      "spokenStart": 171.244,
      "spokenEnd": 177.207,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当执行出现反复失败、证据互相冲突或影响范围扩大时，自动化程度应该下降，责任重新回到人。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.536,
      "audioStart": 177.209,
      "spokenStart": 177.367,
      "spokenEnd": 184.101,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "研究中的典型分工给出方向，但它来自 Claude Code 的交互会话，不是所有行业的固定比例。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.168,
      "audioStart": 184.105,
      "spokenStart": 184.261,
      "spokenEnd": 189.65,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "所以责任卡要写决定类型和升级条件，而不是照抄百分之七十或百分之二十。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.168,
      "audioStart": 189.663,
      "spokenStart": 189.81,
      "spokenEnd": 195.209,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 195.215,
      "spokenStart": 195.369,
      "spokenEnd": 196.054,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，按可逆性和不确定性决定委派深度。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.648,
      "audioStart": 195.997,
      "spokenStart": 196.154,
      "spokenEnd": 198.987,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，把目标、价值和高代价取舍留给人。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.72,
      "audioStart": 198.991,
      "spokenStart": 199.147,
      "spokenEnd": 202.067,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，预先写明失败与冲突何时触发接管。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.984,
      "audioStart": 202.074,
      "spokenStart": 202.227,
      "spokenEnd": 205.412,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第四步是把专业度转成可观察的责任动作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 3.6,
      "audioStart": 205.437,
      "spokenStart": 205.592,
      "spokenEnd": 208.397,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "清晰的任务定义要包含对象、约束、完成证据和明确禁区，不能只给一个模糊愿望。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.408,
      "audioStart": 208.411,
      "spokenStart": 208.557,
      "spokenEnd": 214.187,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "验证要求要在执行前写下，例如必须通过哪些测试、比对哪些原始数据、保留哪些审计痕迹。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.08,
      "audioStart": 214.182,
      "spokenStart": 214.347,
      "spokenEnd": 220.623,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "专业用户会在关键节点纠正 Agent，因为他们能识别看似顺畅却偏离业务规则的结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.48,
      "audioStart": 220.619,
      "spokenStart": 220.783,
      "spokenEnd": 226.455,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "研究的严格验证成功率从新手会话的百分之十五，上升到中级及以上会话的大约百分之二十八到三十三。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.68,
      "audioStart": 226.447,
      "spokenStart": 226.615,
      "spokenEnd": 233.496,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "大部分提升发生在新手到中级之间，说明工作性理解已经能带来很大收益，深度精通的边际增益较小。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.392,
      "audioStart": 233.501,
      "spokenStart": 233.656,
      "spokenEnd": 240.253,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "遇到麻烦时，专家会话转成验证成功的比例也更高；这提醒我们要设计恢复路径，而不是只设计顺利路径。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.776,
      "audioStart": 240.253,
      "spokenStart": 240.413,
      "spokenEnd": 247.397,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 247.403,
      "spokenStart": 247.557,
      "spokenEnd": 248.233,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，把专业知识写成约束和完成证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.48,
      "audioStart": 248.178,
      "spokenStart": 248.333,
      "spokenEnd": 251.014,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，在关键节点主动纠偏，不把流畅当正确。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.936,
      "audioStart": 251.019,
      "spokenStart": 251.174,
      "spokenEnd": 254.324,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，为失败后的诊断、缩小范围和人工接管留出路径。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.824,
      "audioStart": 254.329,
      "spokenStart": 254.484,
      "spokenEnd": 258.516,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第五步，把这些原则落到一张四栏责任分工卡。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 3.96,
      "audioStart": 258.537,
      "spokenStart": 258.696,
      "spokenEnd": 261.869,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第一栏是规划所有者。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.16,
      "audioStart": 261.869,
      "spokenStart": 262.029,
      "spokenEnd": 263.394,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "写出谁定义目标、优先级、允许的取舍和完成标准。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.416,
      "audioStart": 263.339,
      "spokenStart": 263.494,
      "spokenEnd": 267.12,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二栏是执行授权。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.968,
      "audioStart": 267.125,
      "spokenStart": 267.28,
      "spokenEnd": 268.451,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "列出 Agent 可以自主读取、修改、运行和组合的动作，以及明确禁止的动作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.904,
      "audioStart": 268.388,
      "spokenStart": 268.551,
      "spokenEnd": 273.647,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三栏是验证证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.016,
      "audioStart": 273.652,
      "spokenStart": 273.807,
      "spokenEnd": 275.027,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "每个关键结果都绑定测试、原始来源、差异检查或可复现命令。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.28,
      "audioStart": 274.963,
      "spokenStart": 275.127,
      "spokenEnd": 279.593,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第四栏是失败所有者。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.16,
      "audioStart": 279.599,
      "spokenStart": 279.753,
      "spokenEnd": 281.124,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "写清连续失败、证据冲突、范围扩大或不可逆动作出现时由谁接管。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.712,
      "audioStart": 281.065,
      "spokenStart": 281.224,
      "spokenEnd": 286.135,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "使用时先填规划所有者和失败所有者，再开放执行授权，最后逐项核对验证证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.744,
      "audioStart": 286.136,
      "spokenStart": 286.295,
      "spokenEnd": 292.234,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这张卡是基于研究分工与专业度信号整理出的工作流工具，不代表研究已经验证了这张卡本身。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.056,
      "audioStart": 292.234,
      "spokenStart": 292.394,
      "spokenEnd": 298.638,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 298.644,
      "spokenStart": 298.798,
      "spokenEnd": 299.482,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，先指定规划与失败责任人。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.072,
      "audioStart": 299.427,
      "spokenStart": 299.582,
      "spokenEnd": 301.857,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，再开放有边界的执行授权。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.88,
      "audioStart": 301.858,
      "spokenStart": 302.017,
      "spokenEnd": 304.093,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，用预先约定的证据决定是否完成。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.504,
      "audioStart": 304.096,
      "spokenStart": 304.253,
      "spokenEnd": 306.943,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "总结一下，领域专家不是因为少让 Agent 做事而更有效，而是因为他们更清楚目标、约束、证据和接管时机。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 8.016,
      "audioStart": 306.966,
      "spokenStart": 307.123,
      "spokenEnd": 314.337,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "研究仍有边界：成功来自转录分类和可验证信号，不等于真实世界结果；非交互式使用也没有纳入。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.728,
      "audioStart": 314.334,
      "spokenStart": 314.497,
      "spokenEnd": 321.41,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "下次启动 AI Agent 前，先写四栏：规划所有者、执行授权、验证证据、失败所有者。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.936,
      "audioStart": 321.407,
      "spokenStart": 321.57,
      "spokenEnd": 327.705,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
